---
/* The doctrine rail: the station capability's four maxims, displayed as
   product copy — station/docs/index.md carries them in full. */
---

<section class="station-principles" aria-label="Principles">
  <div class="station-principles-inner section-inner">
    <span class="station-principles-label">Principles</span>
    <ul class="station-maxims">
      <li><strong>Capabilities are declared, never inferred.</strong> Absence stays absent.</li>
      <li><strong>Degrade, don&rsquo;t lie.</strong> An outage renders with a reason, not stale numbers.</li>
      <li><strong>No prose on the wire.</strong> Codes and degrees travel; words and colours are yours.</li>
      <li><strong>Your thresholds, your palette.</strong> Banding follows your limits and your tokens.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* ---- zone two: the doctrine rail ----
     The four maxims as one horizontal plate on the page ground between the
     hero band and the toolbar — hairline dividers, no accent. */
  .station-principles-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
  }
  .station-principles-label {
    font: 600 0.66rem/1.6 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
  }
  .station-maxims {
    display: contents;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .station-maxims li {
    align-self: stretch;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    padding-left: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .station-maxims strong { color: var(--ink); display: block; }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .station-principles-inner {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      row-gap: 1.25rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .station-principles-label { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .station-maxims li:nth-child(odd) {
      border-left: none;
      padding-left: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .station-principles-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; row-gap: 1rem; }
    .station-maxims li {
      border-left: none;
      padding-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
